# Supabase Access Rule

## Scope

This rule only applies if/when this repository adds Supabase. Prefer service wrappers in `services/supabase/*`.

## Guideline

- Isolate Supabase access in `services/supabase/*` wrappers.
- Do not call Supabase client methods directly from components, hooks, utils, or route handlers.
- Do not import `@supabase/supabase-js` outside the single client module (e.g. `lib/supabase.ts`). The import itself is the boundary, not just the call.
- Keep wrappers small, focused, and typed.
